REM rickroll.duck - harmless proof of life with a sense of humor.
REM
REM HARMLESS: opens the classic music video in the target's default browser.
REM It runs no commands beyond opening a URL and changes nothing.
REM
REM Targets WINDOWS (uses Win+R "Run" to open the URL). For other OSes see
REM the notes at the bottom. Only plug the device into hardware you own or
REM are authorized to test.

DELAY 800
GUI r
DELAY 600
STRINGLN https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ

REM --- adapting to other OSes ---
REM macOS: replace the two lines above the URL with:
REM   GUI SPACE          (open Spotlight)
REM   DELAY 400
REM   STRING safari
REM   ENTER
REM   DELAY 800
REM   GUI l              (focus the address bar)
REM   STRINGLN https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ
REM Linux (GNOME): GUI opens Activities; type "firefox", ENTER, then address
REM bar (CTRL l) and the URL. Exact keys vary by desktop environment.
